  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b11a58205ec3474ca216360e9fa74a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: AFU_Tutorial Shared Data
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_TableCollectionName: AFU_Tutorial
  m_TableCollectionNameGuidString: 9c9210c1e5c71a044b015e1b14f66847
  m_Entries:
  - m_Id: 9050606470615040
    m_Key: Now for some basics. WASD or LEFT STICK lets you WALK around. MOUSE or
      RIGHT STICK moves the camera!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10089984416468992
    m_Key: Great! Press SPACE or A BUTTON to JUMP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10090015567564800
    m_Key: Now JUMP then press SPACE  or A BUTTON again to start flying!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10090031031963648
    m_Key: You've done so well Peep! There's a few other pigeons you should go see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10090048312496128
    m_Key: Coobert will show you how to SNEAK around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10090080671551488
    m_Key: Ruffle can tell you where to find food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10090101777289216
    m_Key: Race Arnesto to test your skills!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10090115752710144
    m_Key: 'Anytime you think you''re ready, you can take the Coober to Pigeonton
      Market! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10091154472095744
    m_Key: You can use E or X BUTTON to INTERACT or SPEAK with other pigeons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10091160440590336
    m_Key: If you need to see the controls again you can find them in the PAUSE menu
      with ESCAPE or START BUTTON!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13498174986440704
    m_Key: Peep, my feathery friend... You have soo much to learn!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13498211413970944
    m_Key: See your face right there? A healthy bird is important so make sure to
      always look your best!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13498241084477440
    m_Key: That GREEN bar? Stamina help you RUN and FLAP your way out of danger.
      Or in... It's your choice...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13498264253812736
    m_Key: The WHITE? What do we do best? POOP! Make sure to keep that belly full!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13498282230599680
    m_Key: 'Always keep an eye out at your MINI-MAP and COMPASS! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13499494753554432
    m_Key: I or SELECT BUTTON will open your WINGVENTORY. Any ITEMS or ACCESSORIES
      you find can go in here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13499516069007360
    m_Key: 'Pressing M or D-PAD UP will show your MAP '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
